to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":425949,"PostDate":1219300274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know there are not many of us, but I thought we could start our own official thread for all of our questions and thoughts about our upcoming weddings! I hope we can turn this thread into something great like the DT one. Post your date so we can keep track of all the upcoming weddings. <br \/> <br \/> Here are some photos that Natalia sent to me:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i235.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee112\/brios86\/Dreams%20Puerto%20Aventuras\/CopiadeDSC_3427.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i235.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee112\/brios86\/Dreams%20Puerto%20Aventuras\/DSC_0004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i235.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee112\/brios86\/Dreams%20Puerto%20Aventuras\/DSC_0015.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i235.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee112\/brios86\/Dreams%20Puerto%20Aventuras\/DSC_3333.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i235.photobucket.com\/albums\