enturas :: Home<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marknemily5710@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1214008587,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210075.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emaya77","Id":210075,"Name":"emaya77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03c875c7ecb674bb8bb8074e87a0c270","RawContent":"PA is about 30 minutes before Tulum. Its after Playa del Carmen... Its kinda just in the middle of the Rivera Maya.","Attachments":[],"Id":429641,"PostDate":1219684706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                PA is about 30 minutes before Tulum. Its after Playa del Carmen... Its kinda just in the middle of the Rivera Maya.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214427360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47f33732990535840fb2341248c783a0","RawContent":"Thanks!! My niece is booking for June 12, 2009. She wants to have her wedding in the gazebo (I assume the pictures you posted are from the &amp;quot;old&amp;quot; Sunscape resort). Does anyone else plan on having their wedding there and if so, how many chairs can it fit? Will they also decorate the chairs with covers, bows, etc. Also, does anyone know what renovations to the actual resort are being made? I believe she is going for the Ultimate package. She received prices from both Tulum and PA and the PA prices were different on some things.","Attachments":[],"Id":429726,"PostDate":1219690173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks!! My niece is booking for June 12, 2009. She wants to have her wedding in the gazebo (I assume the pictures you posted are from the \"old\" Sunscape resort). Does anyone else plan on having their wedding there and if so, how many chairs can it fit? Will they also decorate the chairs with covers, bows, etc. Also, does anyone know what renovations to the actual resort are being made? I believe she is going for the Ultimate package. She received prices from both Tulum and PA and the PA prices were different on some things.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stathisquo@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219192152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211276.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RoryS","Id":211276,"Name":"RoryS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5ac489c545986dced159577bdd15cf6","RawContent":"Hello Everyone....\n \n I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!","Attachments":[],"Id":433001,"PostDate":1219903689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Everyone....<br \/> <br \/> I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura.yales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215565802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210404.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyales","Id":210404,"Name":"lyales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36d5c597d7ac5eed3669c42797c477bb","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lyales&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello Everyone....\n \n I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Natalia is the wedding coordinator that I have been in contact with... I have not spoken with Jacy at all. The resorts usually have the main coordinator and then their assistant, so maybe each of them are one of those... I will add you to our list... Looks like you are our first DPA bride so far! YAY!","Attachments":[],"Id":433101,"PostDate":1219908479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lyales<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello Everyone....<br \/> <br \/> I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Natalia is the wedding coordinator that I have been in contact with... I have not spoken with Jacy at all. The resorts usually have the main coordinator and then their assistant, so maybe each of them are one of those... I will add you to our list... Looks like you are our first DPA bride so far! YAY!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214427360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"393a36a0b35b4e176069b07a0dce57d8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;RoryS&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks!! My niece is booking for June 12, 2009. She wants to have her wedding in the gazebo (I assume the pictures you posted are from the &amp;quot;old&amp;quot; Sunscape resort). Does anyone else plan on having their wedding there and if so, how many chairs can it fit? Will they also decorate the chairs with covers, bows, etc. Also, does anyone know what renovations to the actual resort are being made? I believe she is going for the Ultimate package. She received prices from both Tulum and PA and the PA prices were different on some things.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I do not know how many chairs the gazebo fits.. Have you tried asking a coordinator? I will try to send them an email sometime this week. I hope they have chair covers! I plan on bringing my own sashes and table runners tho.","Attachments":[],"Id":433109,"PostDate":1219909220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>RoryS<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks!! My niece is booking for June 12, 2009. She wants to have her wedding in the gazebo (I assume the pictures you posted are from the \"old\" Sunscape resort). Does anyone else plan on having their wedding there and if so, how many chairs can it fit? Will they also decorate the chairs with covers, bows, etc. Also, does anyone know what renovations to the actual resort are being made? I believe she is going for the Ultimate package. She received prices from both Tulum and PA and the PA prices were different on some things.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I do not know how many chairs the gazebo fits.. Have you tried asking a coordinator? I will try to send them an email sometime this week. I hope they have chair covers! I plan on bringing my own sashes and table runners tho.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214427360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1e7e33ed33fb674661396b9ec3544a1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lyales&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello Everyone....\n \n I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Looks like the pressure is off, I am no longer the first DPA bride!!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile36\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; It will be nice to have feedback from someone before we head down in May!!! So excited for you lyales, welcome to another DPA bride &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":433526,"PostDate":1219953716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lyales<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello Everyone....<br \/> <br \/> I am so excited that we have started our own group. My fiance and I will be getting married at PA on 2-28-09. I am curious who Natalia is?? I have only been working with Jacy. Please fill me in on any other details that you may know with the hotel and the renovations!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Looks like the pressure is off, I am no longer the first DPA bride!!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile36\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> It will be nice to have feedback from someone before we head down in May!!! So excited for you lyales, welcome to another DPA bride <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp339\/twinkle320\/pro4-1-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/p...pro4-1-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"twinkle320@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216147839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210550.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~*~Margie~*~","Id":210550,"Name":"~*~Margie~*~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"831e5fe3c4a0d1d25bee55bbe4502f5e","RawContent":"&lt;font color=\"Blue\"&gt;hope they have chair covers! I plan on bringing my own sashes and table runners tho.&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n I believe they do have covers, as that was in the information package they sent and is included at least with the Ultimate Package. I&#039;m not sure what color table linens they have. I know she wants orange and pink for her wedding colors. Anyone else used those colors on this board? I know she is bringing her own bows and sashes too. not sure about table runners, tho","Attachments":[],"Id":433736,"PostDate":1219961292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font color=\"Blue\">hope they have chair covers! I plan on bringing my own sashes and table runners tho.<\/font><br \/> <br \/> I believe they do have covers, as that was in the information package they sent and is included at least with the Ultimate Package. I'm not sure what color table linens they have. I know she wants orange and pink for her wedding colors. Anyone else used those colors on this board? I know she is bringing her own bows and sashes too. not sure about table runners, tho\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stathisquo@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219192152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211276.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RoryS","Id":211276,"Name":"RoryS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"799457bb4b1793e1bee8e06f4f461074","RawContent":"Yeah!!! I am happy to be the first DPA bride and I will be sure to bring back tons of information!!! I do have a questions has anyone gotten samples of the pictures from the photographer that is included in the package? From what Jacy told me no outside photographers are allowed in....","Attachments":[],"Id":435014,"PostDate":1220047260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <hea